SCOPE OF THE MIT GRANT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT grant covers **every file in this repository except `contracts/lib/`**.

Stated as an exclusion rather than as a list of included directories, because a
list is a promise that goes stale: adding a directory, a configuration file or
a workflow would silently leave it outside the grant, and a file nobody granted
rights to is all-rights-reserved no matter what the README says. There is one
carve-out and this is it.

`contracts/lib/` holds third-party dependencies redistributed under their own
licences. Those are listed below and their full texts ship alongside the code
they cover. Nothing else in this repository is third-party source.

